{
  "pack_format": "noesis-pack-v1",
  "name": "science",
  "version": "1.2.0",
  "description": "Primary scientific evidence: scholarly works from bounded scholarly APIs, study methodology records, paper families, public peer-review rounds, systematic reviews and preserved citations, and cultural primary sources (DDB, Europeana) linked to research works and places; and mathematics: zbMATH Open literature, OEIS sequences and pinned formal-library declarations (Lean mathlib4, Isabelle AFP) with proof dependencies, revisions and reviewable cross-source links (acquired through config/source_packs/research.json).",
